Official UESI GitHub mirror repository.

UESI, all rights reserved. 2026.

The UESI (Unified Executable System Interface) is a fully Open-Source monolithic POSIX operating system developed by 
https://github.com/rileyCloud & https://github.com/0x16000/
UESI aims to be portable and secure, while also trying to replicate original UNIX behaviour and functionality.

For more information, please read the wiki @ https://lark.miraheze.org/wiki/UESI

